      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Literally nothing would change, what are all of you on about, this is just red status with the benefit of not being tracked as online, people who are gonna use this are already on red or orange, adding invisible isn't going to activate the sleeper cells and kill the platform's social atmosphere, people are already holed up alone just fine without it, this changes nothing, every argument against this has no substance. There is a benefit to adding it too, not being tracked as online gives space to do things privately without being bothered, red status has turned into a beacon of unwellness, i set to red and i'm suddenly answering 50 DMs asking if I'm okay, i set to orange and I get spam invites from individuals excited to hang out when really I came on to attend a private outing or group event, which turns into accusations of ghosting and drama.",
