      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not a fan of this feature. If it is ever introduced, I wish for one thing: people who are on invisible shouldn't be able to see the locations of people on green (and maybe blue too).\n\nThis should be fair from a privacy perspective: you don't want others to see if you're even online or not, but I want to share my location only with people who I know are online.\n\nAlso, this should prevent overuse of this status without a good reason.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
