      "value": "@{5fca36def30ebe2c29400767|full_name} I agree with this as a compromise. I do think it should just never be a feature, but it does make sense to me that it should limit social functionality if you go into that mode, like you not being able to see your friends list, perhaps even limiting the ability to interact with the API (since people could use VRCX to get around it).",
