      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62da67d0d26e9a44bfacf04e|full_name} People having the ability to be offline changes the entire social dynamic of the game in a negative way. The entire point of VRChat is to be social. I would rather us change the culture around Red, as people should learn how to manage boundaries better. If you friends are bothering you based on your online status, that is a boundary you have to set with them.",
